1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,570
Ever wished you could just hurl dirty
laundry at your landlord to pay rent?

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:04,470
Sock 'em up.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,640
That's exactly the plan.

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:08,760
Dive into this delightfully chaotic
adventure where you're battling

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,140
the tiniest tyrant in town.

6
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:14,220
Martha, your Goblin Land league,
the very peculiar payment policy.

7
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:18,570
She demands sock balls for rent,
stinky, squishy, and hand rolled

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,420
zipped through nine levels of
frantic sock matching frenzy.

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,250
Start simple with one sock type.

10
00:00:23,435 --> 00:00:26,045
Then ramp up to juggling
six wildly pattern pairs.

11
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:28,925
Roll em, B, em, and Y,
those sock balls at Martha.

12
00:00:29,075 --> 00:00:32,615
Nail your throws to clear the level
and unlock more of Martha's backstory

13
00:00:32,674 --> 00:00:34,535
and why she's so obsessed with socks.

14
00:00:34,655 --> 00:00:36,605
Smash all nine levels to unlock new game.

15
00:00:36,605 --> 00:00:40,055
Plus where Martha gets faster
sneakier and way harder to hit.

16
00:00:40,295 --> 00:00:43,745
Hunt down cheeky achievements for style
points like hitting Martha 10 times

17
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,545
in the face to become the lint Lord.

18
00:00:45,635 --> 00:00:48,515
And unlock a secret bonus video
packed with gobbling giggles

19
00:00:48,545 --> 00:00:49,715
if you conquer the main game.

20
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,099
Perfect for quick sessions
or marathon throws.

21
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:53,059
Grab your socks.

22
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:54,050
Gear up and settle.

23
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,460
Rent the only way that matters.

24
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,739
The pixelated sock falls and goblin glee.

25
00:00:57,949 --> 00:00:59,030
Start rolling today.

